    ["Make the Coarse Grinding Stone yourself: 92 x Coarse Grinding Stone."] = "Stell Grober Schleifstein selbst her: 92 x Grober Schleifstein.",
    ["Make the Cured Heavy Hide yourself: 20 x Cured Heavy Hide."] = "Stell Geschmeidiger schwerer Balg selbst her: 20 x Geschmeidiger schwerer Balg.",
